  Zipkin v2 data model and API. The span model (ZipkinSpan, Endpoint,
  Annotation, DependencyLink), its JSON field names and the query parameters
  are implemented from the published Zipkin API specification
  (zipkin2-api.yaml) in https://github.com/openzipkin/zipkin-api,
  Copyright The OpenZipkin Authors, licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0. No code of the Zipkin server or of the zipkin2 Java library is
  included.

  B3 propagation. The b3 / X-B3-* header formats follow the specification at
  https://github.com/openzipkin/b3-propagation (Apache License, Version 2.0);
  the propagators themselves come from the OpenTelemetry libraries of each
  language.

  OpenTelemetry to Zipkin mapping. ZipkinSpanExporter maps spans as described
  in the OpenTelemetry specification "OpenTelemetry to Zipkin Transformation"
  (https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/trace/sdk_exporters/zipkin/),
  Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors, licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0. The exporter is written for this SDK and does not contain code
  from the OpenTelemetry Zipkin exporters.

  OpenTelemetry SDKs and B3 propagators (opentelemetry-js, opentelemetry-rust,
